Package: geoperu
Title: Download Spatial Datasets of Peru
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Downloads official spatial datasets of Peru as 'sf' objects
    in 'R'. Includes national, department, and provincial administrative
    boundaries from the National Institute of Statistics and Informatics
    (INEI) <https://ide.inei.gob.pe/> and protected natural areas from the
    National Service of Natural Areas Protected by the State (SERNANP)
    <https://www.gob.pe/institucion/sernanp/pages/21261-acceder-a-informacion-espacial-de-las-area-naturales-protegidas-visor-de-informacion-geografica>.
    Harmonizes attributes, coordinate reference systems, and topology to
    support consistent spatial analysis and visualization.
